{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":498685,"name":"","username":"aliciar","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/73ab20/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T02:49:07.219Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498685-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498685-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498685-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498685-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s been 24 hours since I’ve created a cursor pro account and the Grok Bot Computer cannot be initialized.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve tried updating and resetting the computer but these did not work. Also, there is another user on the same network where Grok Bot works properly for them, therefore, it’s not a network problem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditional, it seems bot names and settings are not propagating between MacOS and iOS apps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498685-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498685-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eN/A.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498685-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498685-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498685-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498685-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot MacOS: 0.58.0\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot iOS: 1.11.1 (116669)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498685-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498685-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T07:03:41.967Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":23,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":116.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172725,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-computer-cannot-initialize-new-account","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139336,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-computer-cannot-initialize-new-account/172725/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":498731,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T04:16:26.909Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/aliciar\"\u003e@aliciar\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the detailed report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t your network or your Mac. Your Grok Bot computer didn’t finish the very first startup, and in that state Reset and Update from the app can’t complete. Please don’t click Reset or Update for now. They won’t work in this state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour account and the bots you created are safe. This is a known issue and we’re fixing it on our side. I’ve passed your case to the team so they can rebuild the computer. We’ll reply here as soon as it’s ready. After that, you’ll need to fully quit Grok Bot from the menu bar icon, then open it again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe fact that bot names and settings don’t sync between Mac and iPhone is most likely caused by the same thing. Those changes sync through the computer. Once the computer is back up, let me know if the names still don’t match across your devices.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T04:16:26.909Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172725,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-computer-cannot-initialize-new-account","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-computer-cannot-initialize-new-account/172725/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":499031,"name":"Mohit","username":"mohitjain","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T11:54:15.203Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/aliciar\"\u003e@aliciar\u003c/a\u003e, your Grok Bot computer has been rebuilt on our side, so it should start up now. Fully quit Grok Bot (Quit from the menu bar or tray icon, not just closing the window) and reopen it, then give it a minute to finish first-time setup. Once it’s up, check whether your bot names and settings now match across your Mac and iPhone, since that should sort out once the computer is running. If anything’s still off, reply here and I’ll take another look.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T11:54:15.203Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172725,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-computer-cannot-initialize-new-account","display_username":"Mohit","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":103596,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-computer-cannot-initialize-new-account/172725/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":499146,"name":"","username":"aliciar","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/73ab20/{si